                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This shutdown fight is about healthcare.\n\nWe visited Equitas Health, a health center in Walnut Hills, to hear how more healthcare cuts would impact so many people in this community.\n\nWe\u2019re fighting to end this shutdown and protect affordable healthcare. https://t.co/r8EI226x62",
